Ladybird’s action state resolves a tab’s value first, then the global
value, then the manifest’s default, as all three engines do. The default
badge background is #d90000, the badgeBackgroundColor default in Gecko’s
ExtensionActions; a translucent background is drawn opaque, as in
Chromium’s IconWithBadgeImageSource; and the default text color is black
or white by WCAG contrast, as Gecko’s ExtensionActions computes it
(Chromium takes both defaults from its color theme).
